      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯……受不了，真是位令人困扰的公主。\n虽然担心你摄取过多的糖分，\n但完全限制也会让你有压力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3a40601919fc4ca11517ac7acfcf87d00bf599028f156526bf173048e9a6f2b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
